<view class="page">
  <text class="eyebrow">从包装小字开始</text>
  <view class="heading">拍清配料，<view>看懂再选择。</view></view>
  <view class="muted">请拍摄包装背面的完整配料表，尽量铺平包装，避开反光和折痕。</view>
  <view class="viewfinder"><view class="label-demo"><text class="subtitle">配料表</text><view>燕麦片、小麦粉、白砂糖、</view><view>植物油、乳粉</view><view class="guide-line"></view></view><text class="frame-hint">文字清晰 · 标签完整 · 光线均匀</text></view>
  <button class="primary" data-source="camera" bindtap="photo" disabled="{{busy}}">拍摄配料表</button>
  <button class="secondary" data-source="album" bindtap="photo" disabled="{{busy}}">从相册选择</button>
  <view class="alternatives"><button class="secondary" bindtap="edit">手动输入</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="barcode" disabled="{{busy}}">扫描条码</button></view>
  <view class="note">当前照片仅供对照录入，不会上传或自动识别；条码可读取，但尚未连接商品数据库。配料知识仅作一般说明，不代替核对实物标签。</view>
  <button class="secondary" bindtap="sample">没有包装？试试燕麦脆饼示例</button>
</view>
